{"seq":6,"slug":"forecasting-systems","title":"预测系统工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/forecasting-systems","wordCount":1647,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"预测系统工程\">预测系统工程</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>预测系统工程（Forecasting System Engineering）关注的是如何将时间序列预测模型从研究环境部署到生产环境，并持续可靠地运行。一个工业级的预测系统不仅仅是一个模型，而是包含数据管道、特征计算、模型训练、预测生成、预测监控和反馈循环的完整闭环系统。系统的设计需要考虑可扩展性（同时预测数万条序列）、自动化（最小化人工干预）和鲁棒性（优雅处理异常数据和模型失效）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[数据源] --&gt; B[数据管道]&#10;    B --&gt; C[特征工程]&#10;    C --&gt; D[模型选择与训练]&#10;    D --&gt; E[预测生成]&#10;    E --&gt; F[预测协调]&#10;    F --&gt; G[预测输出]&#10;    G --&gt; H[预测监控]&#10;    H --&gt; I{性能退化?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[告警 + 重训]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[持续运行]&#10;    J --&gt; D&#10;    H --&gt; L[预测报告]\">graph TD\n    A[数据源] --&gt; B[数据管道]\n    B --&gt; C[特征工程]\n    C --&gt; D[模型选择与训练]\n    D --&gt; E[预测生成]\n    E --&gt; F[预测协调]\n    F --&gt; G[预测输出]\n    G --&gt; H[预测监控]\n    H --&gt; I{性能退化?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[告警 + 重训]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[持续运行]\n    J --&gt; D\n    H --&gt; L[预测报告]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n<th>典型技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据管道</td>\n<td>数据采集、清洗、对齐</td>\n<td>数据新鲜度、完整性</td>\n<td>Airflow, dbt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征计算</td>\n<td>时序特征自动生成</td>\n<td>计算延迟、特征覆盖率</td>\n<td>Spark, tsfresh</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型训练</td>\n<td>自动模型选择与拟合</td>\n<td>训练时间、AIC/BIC</td>\n<td>auto_arima, LightGBM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测生成</td>\n<td>批量/流式预测</td>\n<td>预测延迟、吞吐量</td>\n<td>Ray, Dask</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测协调</td>\n<td>层级一致性调整</td>\n<td>协调误差</td>\n<td>hierarchicalforecast</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测监控</td>\n<td>性能跟踪与告警</td>\n<td>MASE drift, 覆盖率</td>\n<td>自定义监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>预测系统的核心设计原则是&quot;自动化优先，人工兜底&quot;——系统应当能够自动处理绝大多数情况，只在异常场景下升级给人工干预。这要求系统具备自动模型选择、自动异常检测和自动降级三个自动化能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大规模预测架构\">大规模预测架构</h2><p>当需要同时预测数千到数百万条时间序列时（如零售商的 SKU 级销量预测），系统架构面临吞吐量和延迟的双重挑战。常见的架构模式是&quot;分组建模&quot;——将具有相似模式的序列分组，每组使用共享的模型参数或模型选择策略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pandas as pd&#10;import numpy as np&#10;from concurrent.futures import ProcessPoolExecutor&#10;from typing import Dict, List, Callable&#10;&#10;class ScalableForecaster:&#10;    def __init__(self, model_pool, selection_criterion=&#39;aic&#39;):&#10;        self.model_pool = model_pool&#10;        self.selection_criterion = selection_criterion&#10;        self.fitted_models: Dict[str, dict] = {}&#10;&#10;    def forecast_single(self, series_id: str, series: pd.Series,&#10;                          horizon: int) -&gt; dict:&#10;        best_score = np.inf&#10;        best_model = None&#10;        best_forecast = None&#10;&#10;        for model_name, model_fn in self.model_pool.items():&#10;            try:&#10;                model, forecast, metrics = model_fn(series, horizon)&#10;                score = metrics.get(self.selection_criterion, np.inf)&#10;                if score &lt; best_score:&#10;                    best_score = score&#10;                    best_model = model_name&#10;                    best_forecast = forecast&#10;            except Exception:&#10;                continue&#10;&#10;        if best_forecast is None:&#10;            best_forecast = np.full(horizon, series.mean())&#10;            best_model = &#39;fallback_mean&#39;&#10;&#10;        self.fitted_models[series_id] = {&#10;            &#39;model&#39;: best_model,&#10;            &#39;score&#39;: best_score&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        return {&#10;            &#39;series_id&#39;: series_id,&#10;            &#39;model&#39;: best_model,&#10;            &#39;forecast&#39;: best_forecast,&#10;            &#39;score&#39;: best_score&#10;        }&#10;&#10;    def forecast_batch(self, series_dict: Dict[str, pd.Series],&#10;                        horizon: int, n_workers: int = 4) -&gt; List[dict]:&#10;        results = []&#10;&#10;        with ProcessPoolExecutor(max_workers=n_workers) as executor:&#10;            futures = {}&#10;            for sid, series in series_dict.items():&#10;                future = executor.submit(&#10;                    self.forecast_single, sid, series, horizon&#10;                )&#10;                futures[future] = sid&#10;&#10;            for future in futures:&#10;                try:&#10;                    result = future.result(timeout=60)&#10;                    results.append(result)&#10;                except Exception as e:&#10;                    sid = futures[future]&#10;                    results.append({&#10;                        &#39;series_id&#39;: sid,&#10;                        &#39;model&#39;: &#39;timeout_fallback&#39;,&#10;                        &#39;forecast&#39;: np.full(horizon, 0),&#10;                        &#39;error&#39;: str(e)&#10;                    })&#10;&#10;        return results\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pandas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> concurrent.futures </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ProcessPoolExecutor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Dict, List, Callable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ScalableForecaster</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model_pool, selection_criterion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'aic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model_pool </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_pool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.selection_criterion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> selection_criterion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fitted_models: Dict[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style